# Implementation Plan — Migration to 100% Local Open-Source GPU Engine

This plan outlines the technical blueprint to transition **VoiceCart AI** from **Cloud APIs (Mode A)** to a **100% Local Open-Source Stack (Mode B)** once a GPU VPS (NVIDIA 6GB–8GB VRAM) or Apple Silicon server is provisioned.

---

## Technical Objectives & Value

1. **$0 Per-Call API Costs**: Eliminate monthly API bills from Google Cloud STT/TTS and Gemini LLM.
2. **Sub-400ms E2E Latency**: Achieve instantaneous, sub-half-second response times by eliminating international cloud network round-trips.
3. **100% Native Tamil & Tanglish Accuracy**: Use `pratilekha-v0-small` (Whisper-LoRA fine-tuned on Indic accents) and `Piper TTS` (trained on AI4Bharat `IndicVoices-R` dataset).
4. **Dual-Engine Flexibility**: Maintain a seamless feature flag (`AI_ENGINE_MODE=local` vs `cloud`) so the system can instantly switch modes without downtime.

