### New Local Microservices (`/server/src/services/`)

#### [NEW] [localSttService.js](file:///c:/Users/midun/OneDrive/Desktop/Inkiro/server/src/services/localSttService.js)
- Interfaces with local `faster-whisper` C++ WebSocket server loaded with Hugging Face model `anuran-roy/pratilekha-v0-small`.
- Streams 16kHz PCM audio bytes and emits native Tamil/English transcripts in ~150ms.

#### [NEW] [localLlmService.js](file:///c:/Users/midun/OneDrive/Desktop/Inkiro/server/src/services/localLlmService.js)
- Communicates with local `Ollama` API (`http://localhost:11434/api/generate`) running `Qwen-2.5-3B-Instruct`.
- Uses system prompt rules to output strict JSON slot states (items, quantities, variants, addresses, prices).

#### [NEW] [localTtsService.js](file:///c:/Users/midun/OneDrive/Desktop/Inkiro/server/src/services/localTtsService.js)
- Executes local `Piper` ONNX binary loaded with `ta_IN-indicvoices-medium.onnx` weights.
- Converts generated Tamil response text to G.711 mu-law audio buffer in ~80ms.

#### [MODIFY] [dialogueManager.js](file:///c:/Users/midun/OneDrive/Desktop/Inkiro/server/src/services/dialogueManager.js)
- Updates `processDialogueTurn()` to dynamically route requests based on `process.env.AI_ENGINE_MODE`:
  - If `local`, calls `localLlmService.js`.
  - If `cloud`, calls `GoogleGenerativeAI` (Gemini Flash).
  - Falls back to built-in rule engine if both are unreachable.

